---
import CreatorLayout from "../layouts/CreatorLayout.astro";
import { favoriteGames, favoriteMusic, playlist } from "../data/site";
---
<CreatorLayout title="About me | Mochiko" description="Get to know Mochiko: games, music, plushies, tech and a few other things." heroTitle="a little about me" heroSubtitle="most people just say Mochi.">
  <article class="card about-intro page-card">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">HELLO, I’M</span><h2>Mochiko<span class="accent">.</span></h2><p class="pronunciation">ˈmɔtʃiːˌkoː</p><p>i live somewhere in northern germany, usually in front of a pc.</p><p>i’m much more social online than in person. sarcastic, easily distracted, and a bit too invested in whatever i’m playing.</p></div>
    <img src="/assets/about.webp" alt="Mochiko sitting with a bunny plush" width="900" height="1125" loading="lazy" />
  </article>
  <section class="card page-card about-notes">
    <h2 class="panel-title"><i class="ph ph-note-pencil" aria-hidden="true"></i>the short version</h2>
    <p>i like cute things, collecting random stuff, and talking about computers. strategy games and city builders are how a “short session” stops being short.</p>
    <div class="interest-grid"><div><i class="ph ph-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>things i like</h3><p>plushies, foxes, blue, horror movies, and buttons i probably shouldn’t press.</p></div><div><i class="ph ph-prohibit" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>less of a fan</h3><p>horror games. watching a horror movie is fine, being the person with the flashlight is different. also horses.</p></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="feed-section" id="favorites">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2><i class="ph ph-game-controller" aria-hidden="true"></i>my game ranking</h2></div><p class="section-note">yes, there are two #2s. no, i’m not fixing it.</p>
    <div class="game-grid">{favoriteGames.map(game => <a class="card game-card" href={game.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><div><img src={game.image} alt={`${game.title} cover`} width="600" height="800" loading="lazy" /><span>#{game.rank}</span></div><h3>{game.title}</h3>{game.note && <p>{game.note}</p>}</a>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="card page-card music-detail" id="music">
    <h2 class="panel-title"><i class="ph ph-headphones" aria-hidden="true"></i>if it’s fast and bassy</h2><p>genre isn’t really the point. i just like the energy.</p>
    <a class="music-row" href={favoriteMusic.artistHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src={favoriteMusic.artistImage} alt={favoriteMusic.artist} width="100" height="100" loading="lazy" /><span><small>favorite artist</small><strong>{favoriteMusic.artist}</strong></span><i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    <a class="music-row" href={favoriteMusic.songHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src={favoriteMusic.songImage} alt="Bass Cannon cover" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy" /><span><small>favorite song</small><strong>{favoriteMusic.song}</strong><small>{favoriteMusic.songDetail}</small></span><i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    <a class="btn secondary" href={playlist.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><i class="ph ph-spotify-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i>my Spotify playlist<i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
  </section>
</CreatorLayout>
